{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>אלי</b> — Some say אללי לי. Yefet says: the alef is in place of the heh, as in הילילי. He did not speak correctly. Had he said that the alef is in place of the yod in יללה, that too would be correct. The prophet says to the land אלי, or to his soul, like a virgin whose husband of her youth dies in her days of joy."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:21.125245321Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}